  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Version:\nw_2022.2.2p-d91537218d\nDescription of the bug:\nNow in open beta, a dedicated input function has been added for pasting when entering input field.\nHowever, when using this to paste, all newlines. on the clipboard are ignored and cannot be pasted correctly.\nWe use this feature to paste documents created in Notepad and share the content, including \"newline\".\nIf the line breaks are lost, we will not be able to display that.\nPlease refer to the image.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nPaste a string including \"newline\" into \"Input Field\" using OpenBeta's functionality, and output the input \"string\" variable to \"Text\" or \"Test Mesh Pro\".",
